UsingObject.keys()is a simple example of metaprogramming.

I typical metaprogramming task is tomodify object behaviour:

Metaprogramming involves dynamic code generation.

JavaScript cangenerate functionsat runtime:

The two objectsProxyandReflectallow for programming at the meta level in JavaScript.

Proxycan be used tointercept property operationslike reading or writing.

